  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING&#xa0; CHANGE AND&#xa0; RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Girls and boys with disabilities have improved access to inclusive, quality education alongside their peers in Cameroon. Improved access of children with disabilities to quality education through  inclusive teaching practices, accessible school environments and supportive civil society and  government structures in three regions of Cameroon.   To improve the enrolment and retention of children with disabilities by strengthening the delivery of inclusive education, creating an accessible school environment and increasing the financial and social support of civil society and government structures in three regions of Cameroon.</narrative>
  </description>
